---

▶️ How to Run

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open "index.html" in a web browser.
3. Enter the first statement.
4. Enter the second statement.
5. Click Analyze Relationship.
6. View the detected relationship and analysis.

The application can also be deployed using GitHub Pages.

---

🧪 Sample Test Cases

Statement 1| Statement 2| Expected Result
The library is open today.| The library is closed today.| Contradiction
Students can submit assignments online.| Students cannot submit assignments online.| Contradiction
The library has 5000 books.| The library has 8000 books.| Possible Conflict
Students can access the library.| Students can use the library.| Related / Agreeing
The college has a computer laboratory.| The hostel provides breakfast.| Unrelated

